#: codec/1/257/0x101110/24
msgid ""
"There are no borders in this world.\n"
msgstr ""
"这世上没有国界。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/25
msgid ""
"The same conclusion, again and again... Where is\n"
"the flaw?\n"
msgstr ""
"同样结论，一次又一次……破绽\n"
"在哪？\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/26
msgid ""
"All right. Let's try something else. Commencing test.\n"
msgstr ""
"好吧。换个方式。开始测试。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/27
msgid ""
"Understood.\n"
msgstr ""
"明白。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/28
msgid ""
"...You're crossing a suspension bridge.\n"
msgstr ""
"……你正走过一座吊桥。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/29
msgid ""
"Is this my mission?\n"
msgstr ""
"这是我任务？\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/30
msgid ""
"Yes. Your destination is the other side.\n"
msgstr ""
"对。你的目的地是对岸。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/31
msgid ""
"The bridge is wide enough for only one person to\n"
"pass at a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座桥很窄，一次只能让一个人\n"
"通过。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/32
msgid ""
"A man is approaching from the opposite side. He's\n"
"carrying a gun.\n"
msgstr ""
"对面有个人正在靠近。他\n"
"手里拿着一把枪。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/33
msgid ""
"I shoot him.\n"
msgstr ""
"我开枪打他。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/34
msgid ""
"Suppose he's your husband?\n"
msgstr ""
"假如他是你丈夫？\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/35
msgid ""
"...I shoot him.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我开枪打他。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/36
msgid ""
"In self defense?\n"
msgstr ""
"自卫？\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/37
msgid ""
"To spare him the grief. One must die, and one\n"
"must live.\n"
msgstr ""
"免他悲伤。必须死一个，活\n"
"一个。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/38
msgid ""
"...Next question.\n"
msgstr ""
"……下一个问题。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/39
msgid ""
"Your father asks you to fix the roof and mow the\n"
"lawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"你父亲让你去修屋顶，还要修剪\n"
"草坪。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/40
msgid ""
"When you climb the ladder onto the roof, the\n"
"ladder is taken away.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你爬上梯子到屋顶时，梯子\n"
"被拿走了。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/41
msgid ""
"I fix the roof.\n"
msgstr ""
"我修屋顶。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/42
msgid ""
"And when you're finished?\n"
msgstr ""
"修完之后呢？\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/43
msgid ""
"I jump down.\n"
msgstr ""
"我跳下去。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/44
msgid ""
"You'll break more than bones at this height.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个高度，断的不只是骨头。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/45
msgid ""
"I see no need to change my decision. I have not\n"
"finished mowing the lawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"我看没必要改变我的决定。我还没\n"
"修剪完草坪。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/46
msgid ""
"I must remain loyal to the mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"我必须忠于任务。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/47
msgid ""
"...Next.\n"
msgstr ""
"……下一个。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/48
msgid ""
"There is a snake in the bushes. It is poisonous. I\n"
"need you to get rid of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"灌木丛里有一条蛇。它有毒。我\n"
"需要你去把它除掉。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/49
msgid ""
"I chase it back to its nest.\n"
msgstr ""
"我追它回巢。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/50
msgid ""
"You can't. The snake's too vicious. It's already\n"
"killed many people.\n"
msgstr ""
"你做不到。那条蛇太凶残了。它已经\n"
"杀了好多人。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/51
msgid ""
"...I chase it away.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我把它赶走。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/52
msgid ""
"It will bite you unless you kill it.\n"
msgstr ""
"你不杀它，它就会咬你。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/53
msgid ""
"Go home!\n"
msgstr ""
"回家去！\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/54
msgid ""
"...Kill me... Kill me now...\n"
msgstr ""
"……杀了我……现在就杀了我……\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/55
msgid ""
"Why not kill the snake? Your mission is to get rid\n"
"of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"为何不杀蛇？任务就是\n"
"除掉它。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/56
msgid ""
"Is this what you call loyalty?\n"
msgstr ""
"这就是你说的忠诚？\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/57
msgid ""
"What are you loyal to? Country? Ideology?\n"
"Feelings?\n"
msgstr ""
"你忠于啥？国家？思想？\n"
"感情？\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/58
msgid ""
"I... I...\n"
msgstr ""
"我……我……\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/59
msgid ""
"I am loyal to myself.\n"
msgstr ""
"我忠于自己。\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/60
msgid ""
"...Who's there?!\n"
msgstr ""
"……谁？！\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/61
msgid ""
"Who's that?!\n"
msgstr ""
"谁？！\n"

#: codec/1/257/0x101110/62
msgid ""
"Intruder!\n"
msgstr ""
"有入侵者！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/0
msgid ""
"Enter simulation date.\n"
msgstr ""
"输入模拟日期。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/1
msgid ""
"August 24.\n"
msgstr ""
"8月24日。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/2
msgid ""
"Location?\n"
msgstr ""
"地点？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/3
msgid ""
"Tselinoyarsk, USSR.\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联，采利诺亚尔斯克。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/4
msgid ""
"Mission?\n"
msgstr ""
"任务？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/5
msgid ""
"Support a covert agent whose objective is the\n"
"rescue of a nuclear weapons scientist.\n"
msgstr ""
"支援一名秘密特工，其目标是\n"
"营救一名核武器科学家。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/6
msgid ""
"Who is the agent?\n"
msgstr ""
"特工是谁？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/7
msgid ""
"Your student. Your... most beloved...\n"
msgstr ""
"你学生。你最爱的……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/8
msgid ""
"...Acknowledged. Define current mission progress.\n"
msgstr ""
"……明白。说明当前任务进展。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/9
msgid ""
"With your help, the agent has successfully made\n"
"contact with the target.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你的帮助下，特工成功\n"
"与目标取得了联系。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/10
msgid ""
"All that's left is to wait for recovery.\n"
msgstr ""
"剩下的就是等待接应。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/11
msgid ""
"Now, deduce the best course of action.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在，推断最佳行动方案。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/12
msgid ""
"...I take the scientist away from the agent.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我从特工手中带走科学家。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/14
msgid ""
"As a gift when I defect.\n"
msgstr ""
"叛逃献礼。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/15
msgid ""
"...Why are you defecting?\n"
msgstr ""
"……你为何叛逃？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/16
msgid ""
"To reform my Special Forces unit with my former\n"
"comrades-in-arms.\n"
msgstr ""
"重组我的特种部队，与我的前战友们\n"
"并肩作战。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/17
msgid ""
"NO! I don't want to know your objective. I'm asking\n"
"for the reason.\n"
msgstr ""
"不！我不想知道你的目标。我问的是\n"
"原因。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/18
msgid ""
"Why are you betraying your country?\n"
msgstr ""
"你为何背叛你的国家？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/19
msgid ""
"...I do not defect in order to betray America.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我叛逃并非为背叛美国。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/20
msgid ""
"Betrayal is merely the outcome of that defection.\n"
msgstr ""
"背叛只是叛逃的结果。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/21
msgid ""
"Response time is always slower here...\n"
msgstr ""
"这里响应总是更慢……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/22
msgid ""
"Perhaps she lacks confidence in her judgment.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许她对自己的判断缺乏信心。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/23
msgid ""
"You're a hero in the West. Why should the Soviets\n"
"trust you?\n"
msgstr ""
"你在西方是个英雄。苏联人凭什么\n"
"信任你？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/24
msgid ""
"In addition to the scientist,\n"
msgstr ""
"除科学家外，\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/25
msgid ""
"I provide them with a portable nuclear warhead\n"
msgstr ""
"我还提供一枚便携核弹头\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/26
msgid ""
"in order to win the favor of a Russian GRU officer.\n"
msgstr ""
"以博取一名苏联GRU军官的欢心。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/27
msgid ""
"...And then you launched it.\n"
msgstr ""
"……然后你发射了。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/28
msgid ""
"Launched... the nuke? Me?\n"
msgstr ""
"发射……核弹？我？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/29
msgid ""
"That's right. At a target inside Soviet territory.\n"
msgstr ""
"没错。目标是苏联境内。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/30
msgid ""
"Nuclear weapons... make my blood run cold. They\n"
"blot out the future. How... could I...?\n"
msgstr ""
"核武器……让我胆寒。它们\n"
"抹杀未来。我……怎能……？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/31
msgid ""
"Karma... Is... is it my karma?\n"
msgstr ""
"业……这……这是我的业吗？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/32
msgid ""
"The karma my mistake has brought upon us... My...\n"
"My...\n"
msgstr ""
"我错给我们的业……我的……\n"
"我的……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/33
msgid ""
"Attention. Discontinue forward reasoning.\n"
"Cross-check with knowledge base.\n"
msgstr ""
"注意。停止向前推理。\n"
"与知识库交叉核对。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/34
#: codec/1/265/0x109080/40
msgid ""
"Affirmative.\n"
msgstr ""
"确认。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/35
msgid ""
"...Cross-check complete. Revising conclusion as\n"
"follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"……交叉核对完成。修正结论\n"
"如下：\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/36
msgid ""
"I steal the new weapons developed by the scientist\n"
msgstr ""
"我偷走科学家研发的新武器\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/37
msgid ""
"and then launch the nuke at the weapons design\n"
"bureau.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后向武器设计局发射核弹。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/38
msgid ""
"Forward and backward reasoning are in conflict...\n"
msgstr ""
"正向与反向推理冲突……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/39
msgid ""
"Attention. Return to forward reasoning.\n"
msgstr ""
"注意。回到正向推理。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/41
msgid ""
"...Your apprentice returns for the scientist.\n"
msgstr ""
"……你的徒弟回来找科学家了。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/42
msgid ""
"I send him away.\n"
msgstr ""
"我赶走他。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/43
msgid ""
"He doesn't give up.\n"
msgstr ""
"他不肯放弃。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/44
msgid ""
"I send my comrades to defeat him.\n"
msgstr ""
"我派同伴去击败他。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/45
msgid ""
"All of them fail.\n"
msgstr ""
"全失败了。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/46
msgid ""
"Even the GRU officer who oversaw your defection\n"
"is defeated by your apprentice\n"
msgstr ""
"连监督你叛逃的格鲁乌军官\n"
"也被你的徒弟击败\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/47
msgid ""
"- along with the new weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"连同新武器。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/48
msgid ""
"Now, what is your course of action?\n"
msgstr ""
"那么，你会怎么做？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/49
msgid ""
"...I fight him.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我跟他打。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/50
msgid ""
"Why? With your GRU patron dead, there's no\n"
"reason for you to fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"为啥？格鲁乌靠山已死，\n"
"你没理由再打。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/51
msgid ""
"Why not just run away?\n"
msgstr ""
"何不一走了之？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/52
msgid ""
"I... must fight him.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……必须跟他打。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/53
msgid ""
"I do not see the reason. With a solider of your\n"
"caliber on his side,\n"
msgstr ""
"我想不通。以你这种身手的士兵\n"
"在他那边，\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/54
msgid ""
"how could the GRU officer be defeated to begin\n"
"with? Did you betray him, too?\n"
msgstr ""
"格鲁乌军官怎么可能被击败？\n"
"你也背叛了他？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/55
msgid ""
"I... I've been waiting... for a long time.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……我已经等了……很久。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/56
msgid ""
"You could switch allegiance from GRU to KGB,\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以从格鲁乌转投克格勃，\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/57
msgid ""
"and take the remaining nuke as a gift.\n"
msgstr ""
"把剩下的核弹当见面礼。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/58
msgid ""
"There's no chance they wouldn't welcome a hero\n"
"of your stature.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们绝不会拒绝你这种\n"
"级别的英雄。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/59
msgid ""
"Drift away. My place is with them now.\n"
msgstr ""
"走吧。我归宿跟他们一起。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/60
msgid ""
"I didn't ask you that! Give me the basis for your\n"
"reasoning! Tell me the truth...\n"
msgstr ""
"我没问这个！给我你推理的依据！\n"
"说实话……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/61
msgid ""
"Politics determine who you face on the battlefield.\n"
msgstr ""
"政治决定你在战场上面对谁。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/62
msgid ""
"Why won't you answer me?! It's like you were just\n"
"waiting for him to kill you!\n"
msgstr ""
"你为什么不回答我？！\n"
"简直像在等他杀你！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/63
msgid ""
"I was disloyal... Betrayed my country... I deserve to\n"
"die...\n"
msgstr ""
"我不忠……背叛了我的国家……我该死……\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/64
msgid ""
"How can you say that?! You can't be a traitor!\n"
"You're not that kind of person!\n"
msgstr ""
"你怎么能这么说？！你不可能是叛徒！\n"
"你不是那种人！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/65
msgid ""
"Kill me... Kill me now...\n"
msgstr ""
"杀了我……现在就杀了我……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/66
msgid ""
"STOP IT! STOP IT! Attention! Discontinue reasoning!!\n"
msgstr ""
"住手！住手！注意！停止推理！！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/67
msgid ""
"One must die, and one must live...\n"
msgstr ""
"一人得死，一人得活……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/68
msgid ""
"Stop it, damn you! DISCONTINUE!\n"
msgstr ""
"住手，该死的！停止！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/69
msgid ""
"Life's end... Isn't it beautiful...?\n"
msgstr ""
"生命的终结……不美吗……？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/70
msgid ""
"SHUT DOWN!!\n"
msgstr ""
"关机！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/71
msgid ""
"...Always in the same place, her reasoning goes\n"
"haywire.\n"
msgstr ""
"……总在同一处，她推理就\n"
"出错。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/72
msgid ""
"Someone holds the key... Perhaps it's him...\n"
msgstr ""
"有人握着钥匙……也许是他……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/73
msgid ""
"I'll get it out of him. One way or another...!\n"
msgstr ""
"我会撬开他嘴。不管怎样……！\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/0
msgid ""
"As of today I will be living here at Mother Base.\n"
"Now my real trial begins.\n"
msgstr ""
"从今天起我就住在母基地了。\n"
"现在真正的考验开始了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/1
msgid ""
"Zadornov was paying my room, board, and tuition,\n"
msgstr ""
"扎多尔诺夫付我的食宿和学费，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/2
msgid ""
"but he has since been captured.\n"
msgstr ""
"但他后来被抓了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/3
msgid ""
"I told the man that with no more money from the\n"
"KGB,\n"
msgstr ""
"我告诉那人，KGB\n"
"不再给钱了，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/4
msgid ""
"I could no longer afford school.\n"
msgstr ""
"我再也上不起学了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/5
msgid ""
"...He bought my story, and when I said I would be\n"
"willing to work,\n"
msgstr ""
"……他相信了我的说辞，当我说我\n"
"愿意工作时，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/6
msgid ""
"he took pity on me and let me stay.\n"
msgstr ""
"他可怜我，让我留下。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/7
msgid ""
"For some reason Miller really plead my case.\n"
msgstr ""
"不知为何米勒真替我求了情。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/8
msgid ""
"That was helpful, but the man is still a fool.\n"
msgstr ""
"那有用，但这人还是个蠢货。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/9
msgid ""
"His men are no better.\n"
msgstr ""
"他手下也一样。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/10
msgid ""
"They think their training makes them strong,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们以为训练让他们变强，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/11
msgid ""
"but that kind of strength is nothing in the face of\n"
"true power.\n"
msgstr ""
"但那种力量在\n"
"真正的力量面前不值一提。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/12
msgid ""
"And better yet, they wait on me hand and foot,\n"
msgstr ""
"更妙的是，他们对我百般伺候，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/13
msgid ""
"believing I am just a schoolgirl.\n"
msgstr ""
"以为我只是个女学生。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/14
msgid ""
"Looks like I won't be working too hard, after all.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来我不用太辛苦。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/15
msgid ""
"Just today,\n"
msgstr ""
"今天，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/16
msgid ""
"while scouting out the living quarters,\n"
msgstr ""
"我侦察生活区时，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/17
msgid ""
"I saw a group of them in the corner of the deck\n"
"making a fuss.\n"
msgstr ""
"看到甲板角落有一群人\n"
"在闹腾。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/18
msgid ""
"Going over for a look, I saw they were feeding a\n"
"kitten.\n"
msgstr ""
"我过去一看，他们在喂\n"
"一只小猫。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/19
msgid ""
"A bunch of grown, hard men, and they are the\n"
"ones acting like schoolgirls!\n"
msgstr ""
"一群粗壮的硬汉，\n"
"却像女学生一样！\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/20
msgid ""
"\"Look, isn't he cute?\" What is wrong with them?\n"
msgstr ""
"“看，它多可爱？”他们有病吧？\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/21
msgid ""
"Disgusted, I just nodded and smiled.\n"
msgstr ""
"我嫌恶地点点头笑笑。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/22
msgid ""
"I must stay in character, after all.\n"
msgstr ""
"毕竟我得演好角色。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/23
msgid ""
"I indulged their chit-chat for a few moments,\n"
msgstr ""
"我陪他们闲聊了几句，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/24
msgid ""
"then one of them asked me to give the thing a\n"
"name.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后有人让我给那东西\n"
"起个名。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/25
msgid ""
"They had just taken it from its mother.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们刚把它从母猫身边拿走。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/26
msgid ""
"I named it Nuke.\n"
msgstr ""
"我给它起名核弹。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/27
msgid ""
"I improvised some nonsense about how\n"
msgstr ""
"我随口编了句胡话，说\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/28
msgid ""
"\"our compassion for living things can help prevent\n"
"wars.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"“对生命的怜悯能防止\n"
"战争。”\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/29
msgid ""
"The men gave me a little fish.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们给我条小鱼。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/30
msgid ""
"I held it out in my palm, and the kitten happily ate\n"
"it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"我摊在手心，小猫高兴地\n"
"吃了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/31
msgid ""
"What a pathetic... feeble creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"多可悲……软弱生物。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/32
msgid ""
"It sickens me.\n"
msgstr ""
"真恶心。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/0
msgid ""
"Today Chico invited me to go fishing with the\n"
"soldiers.\n"
msgstr ""
"今天奇科邀我和士兵们\n"
"去钓鱼。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/1
msgid ""
"I suppose finding one's own food does have its\n"
"merit,\n"
msgstr ""
"自己找食物或许有\n"
"好处，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/2
msgid ""
"but I prefer not to be involved in such a degrading\n"
"task.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我不想干这种\n"
"丢人的事。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/3
msgid ""
"And their prattling on about fishing being \"fun\" is\n"
"nonsense.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们唠叨钓鱼多“好玩”，\n"
"纯属胡扯。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/4
msgid ""
"I'm not here to find playmates.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不是来找玩伴的。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/5
msgid ""
"Nevertheless, distasteful as it was,\n"
msgstr ""
"尽管如此，虽然恶心，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/6
msgid ""
"I went along in order to maintain my cover.\n"
msgstr ""
"我为了维持伪装才跟去的。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/7
msgid ""
"Chico thrust a fishing pole into my hands, and we\n"
"went up onto the deck,\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科把一根鱼竿塞进我手里，我们\n"
"走上了甲板，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/8
msgid ""
"where several soldiers had gathered.\n"
msgstr ""
"那里聚着几个士兵。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/9
msgid ""
"They welcomed us warmly.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们热情地欢迎我们。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/10
msgid ""
"With so few women aboard Mother Base, I'm\n"
"treated like a princess.\n"
msgstr ""
"母基地女人少，我\n"
"被当公主对待。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/11
msgid ""
"No one suspects I'm neither a teenager nor a\n"
"student.\n"
msgstr ""
"没人怀疑我既不是少女也不是\n"
"学生。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/12
msgid ""
"It was nice and sunny,\n"
msgstr ""
"天气晴朗，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/13
msgid ""
"with a gentle breeze and waves.\n"
msgstr ""
"微风轻拂，波浪轻摇。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/14
msgid ""
"As I cast my line and waited for a bite,\n"
msgstr ""
"我抛下鱼线等鱼上钩，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/15
msgid ""
"the soldiers began to ask me all sorts of questions.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们开始问我各种问题。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/16
msgid ""
"As always,\n"
msgstr ""
"一如既往，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/17
msgid ""
"I answered according to our pre-defined scenario,\n"
"feigning a smile.\n"
msgstr ""
"我按照我们预先设定的剧本回答，\n"
"假装微笑。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/18
msgid ""
"As I sat there feeding them lies, the fish began to\n"
"bite,\n"
msgstr ""
"我坐着灌他们谎话，鱼开始\n"
"上钩了，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/19
msgid ""
"and the soldiers began to focus on their prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们也开始专注自己的猎物。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/20
msgid ""
"Chico had his bait stolen by a fish,\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科的鱼饵被鱼叼走了，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/21
msgid ""
"and got so angry that he stood up and nearly fell\n"
"into the sea.\n"
msgstr ""
"他气得站了起来，差点\n"
"掉进海里。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/22
msgid ""
"Everybody laughed.\n"
msgstr ""
"大家都笑了。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/23
msgid ""
"It almost made me want to join in, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"我几乎也想跟着笑。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/24
msgid ""
"At some point, I got a bite myself.\n"
msgstr ""
"后来，我也钓到一条。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/25
msgid ""
"The instant after I felt that first gentle tug,\n"
msgstr ""
"感到那轻轻一拽的瞬间，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/26
msgid ""
"the fish yanked the line with astonishing strength,\n"
msgstr ""
"鱼以惊人的力气猛拉鱼线，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/27
msgid ""
"and I let out a cry of surprise.\n"
msgstr ""
"我惊叫出声。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/28
msgid ""
"I thought it was going to be huge.\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为会很大。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/29
msgid ""
"It was my first time fishing, and I was a bit\n"
"flustered,\n"
msgstr ""
"那是我第一次钓鱼，我有点\n"
"手忙脚乱，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/30
msgid ""
"so the soldier beside me helped by supporting the\n"
"pole from behind.\n"
msgstr ""
"于是我旁边的士兵从后面帮我撑住\n"
"鱼竿。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/31
msgid ""
"\"Reel it in!\" they shouted.\n"
msgstr ""
"\"收线！\"他们喊道。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/32
msgid ""
"I nodded, turning the handle as fast as I could.\n"
msgstr ""
"我点点头，拼命转动手柄。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/33
msgid ""
"I wondered what kind of fish live below the surface,\n"
msgstr ""
"我猜水面下有什么鱼，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/34
msgid ""
"and thought back to the deep-sea dives I had to\n"
"do as part of training.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后回想起训练时\n"
"不得不做的深海潜水。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/35
msgid ""
"Those were difficult days,\n"
msgstr ""
"那段日子很苦，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/36
msgid ""
"but I remember finding the multi-colored fish\n"
"gliding through the water incredibly soothing.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我记得发现那些五彩斑斓的鱼\n"
"在水中滑行，令人无比舒缓。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/37
msgid ""
"After a hard fight, I pulled it up. To my surprise,\n"
msgstr ""
"苦战后，我拉它上来。没想到，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/38
msgid ""
"it wasn't even half a vara (16 in). Rather\n"
"anti-climactic.\n"
msgstr ""
"还不到半巴拉（16英寸）。真\n"
"扫兴。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/39
msgid ""
"But I wasn't doing it for fun, so I wasn't the least\n"
"bit disappointed.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我不是为了好玩才做的，所以我一点也不\n"
"失望。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/40
msgid ""
"Nuke was hovering nearby with an expectant look\n"
"on his face, so I gave the fish to him.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nuke 带着期待的表情在附近徘徊，\n"
"于是我把鱼给了他。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/41
msgid ""
"All in all, a thoroughly wasted day.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之，白费了一天。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/0
msgid ""
"Futbol, or \"soccer\" as it is known in the states,\n"
msgstr ""
"Futbol，美国人叫\"soccer\"，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/1
msgid ""
"is extremely popular here.\n"
msgstr ""
"在这里极受欢迎。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/2
msgid ""
"It has not caught on yet in the US,\n"
msgstr ""
"美国还没流行起来，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/3
msgid ""
"but it has legions of rabid fans all across Latin\n"
"America.\n"
msgstr ""
"但它在整个拉丁美洲\n"
"拥有大批狂热粉丝。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/4
msgid ""
"These fans can get so rowdy\n"
msgstr ""
"这些球迷闹起来，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/5
msgid ""
"that it is commonly believed El Salvador and\n"
"Honduras went to war in 1969 over scuffles in a\n"
"soccer match.\n"
msgstr ""
"人们普遍认为萨尔瓦多和\n"
"洪都拉斯在1969年因一场\n"
"足球比赛中的冲突而开战。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/6
msgid ""
"In reality, tensions between the two countries were\n"
"already high.\n"
msgstr ""
"实际上，两国之间的紧张局势\n"
"早已高涨。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/7
msgid ""
"The match was merely one of the sparks that set\n"
"them off.\n"
msgstr ""
"那场比赛仅仅是\n"
"点燃导火索的火花之一。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/8
msgid ""
"But these people are so passionate about the\n"
"sport\n"
msgstr ""
"但这些人对这项运动\n"
"如此狂热\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/9
msgid ""
"that the story seems plausible.\n"
msgstr ""
"这说法听着也像真的。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/10
msgid ""
"Predictably, many of the soldiers here are fans.\n"
msgstr ""
"不出所料，这里很多兵都是球迷。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/11
msgid ""
"They have apparently divided themselves\n"
msgstr ""
"他们显然分成了\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/12
msgid ""
"into Costa Rican and Nicaraguan teams and\n"
"started playing each other.\n"
msgstr ""
"分成哥斯达黎加队和尼加拉瓜队，\n"
"开始互相比赛。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/13
msgid ""
"To play, you need a ball and two goals.\n"
msgstr ""
"踢球需要球和两个球门。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/14
msgid ""
"The R&D team built and set up simple goals on the\n"
"deck.\n"
msgstr ""
"研发团队在甲板上\n"
"搭建了简易球门。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/15
msgid ""
"I had absolutely no interest,\n"
msgstr ""
"我完全没兴趣，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/16
msgid ""
"but Chico insisted that I come and watch.\n"
msgstr ""
"但奇科非要我来看。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/17
msgid ""
"It was not a proper match by any means -\n"
msgstr ""
"这根本算不上正规比赛——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/18
msgid ""
"the pitch was not even regulation size -\n"
msgstr ""
"场地连标准尺寸都不到——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/19
msgid ""
"but the players and spectators alike got pretty\n"
"excited.\n"
msgstr ""
"但球员和观众都\n"
"相当兴奋。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/20
msgid ""
"They banged empty cans and shouted cheers\n"
"through the handmade megaphones.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们敲着空罐子，用自制扩音器\n"
"呐喊助威。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/21
msgid ""
"It almost felt like Carnival.\n"
msgstr ""
"简直像狂欢节。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/22
msgid ""
"Huey, the referee, blew a whistle to start the\n"
"match.\n"
msgstr ""
"裁判 Huey 吹响哨子\n"
"开始比赛。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/23
msgid ""
"The soldiers' training has left them in excellent\n"
"physical shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们的训练让他们保持了\n"
"极佳的体能状态。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/24
msgid ""
"But they lacked the honed skills of professionals,\n"
msgstr ""
"但缺乏职业球员的精湛技术，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/25
msgid ""
"and their play was quite rough.\n"
msgstr ""
"踢得相当粗野。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/26
msgid ""
"Midway through, one of the men collided with\n"
"another.\n"
msgstr ""
"比赛到一半，一人\n"
"与另一人相撞。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/27
msgid ""
"They started shouting at one another, but Huey\n"
"stepped in.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们开始互相叫嚷，但 Huey\n"
"介入调解。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/28
msgid ""
"\"I thought we had forsaken our countries, become\n"
"one with the earth,\" he said,\n"
msgstr ""
"“我以为我们已舍弃祖国，与大地\n"
"融为一体，”他说，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/29
msgid ""
"quoting Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"引用着SNAKE的话。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/30
msgid ""
"\"We're not competing for national pride here.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我们不是为国家荣誉而战。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/31
msgid ""
"And we are not fighting for the good of any one\n"
"country.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"我们不是为任何一个国家的\n"
"利益而战。”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/32
msgid ""
"\"This is not a war. Soccer's a peaceful sport, am I\n"
"right?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"“这不是战争。足球是一项和平的运动，\n"
"我说得对吧？”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/33
msgid ""
"The soldiers nodded.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们点头。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/34
msgid ""
"They know the pain of war, and they share Snake's\n"
"vision.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们懂战争之痛，也认同SNAKE的\n"
"理念。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/35
msgid ""
"Perhaps that is why this all resonates with them.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许正因如此，才引起他们共鸣。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/36
msgid ""
"Team Costa Rica was down a man,\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加队少一人，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/37
msgid ""
"and somehow I was picked to fill in.\n"
msgstr ""
"不知怎的选中我替补。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/38
msgid ""
"Costa Rica had the advantage up until that point -\n"
msgstr ""
"此前哥斯达黎加一直占优——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/39
msgid ""
"I suppose Huey wanted to keep it balanced.\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊大概想保持平衡。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/40
msgid ""
"The soldiers agreed with Huey's call.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们都赞同休伊的决定。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/41
msgid ""
"Maybe the Costa Rican players felt an even match\n"
"up would be more fun, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许哥斯达黎加球员也觉得势均力敌\n"
"的比赛更好玩。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/42
msgid ""
"I could not be bothered to run at first,\n"
msgstr ""
"一开始我懒得跑，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/43
msgid ""
"but chasing the ball out there in the hot sun, I was\n"
"soon drenched in sweat.\n"
msgstr ""
"但在烈日下追着球跑，我很快\n"
"就浑身是汗。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/44
msgid ""
"Before long I found myself actively seeking out the\n"
"ball,\n"
msgstr ""
"没过多久我就发现自己主动去\n"
"找球了，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/45
msgid ""
"partially out of desperation.\n"
msgstr ""
"一半是出于无奈。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/46
msgid ""
"I picked up a loose ball deep on the opponents'\n"
"side of the field.\n"
msgstr ""
"我在对方半场深处捡到一个\n"
"散球。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/47
msgid ""
"Even though he's Nicaraguan, Chico cheered me\n"
"on, yelling \"Go for it! Shoot!\"\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科是尼加拉瓜人，却为我\n"
"加油喊“冲啊！射门！”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/48
msgid ""
"I launched that ball as hard as I could,\n"
msgstr ""
"我用尽全力踢出那球，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/49
msgid ""
"only to have it blocked by the keeper.\n"
msgstr ""
"却被守门员挡了下来。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/50
msgid ""
"Disappointment only increased my determination.\n"
msgstr ""
"失望反而让我更坚定。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/51
msgid ""
"In the end, I didn't score a single goal,\n"
msgstr ""
"最后我一个球都没进，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/52
msgid ""
"and Costa Rica gave up its lead.\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加丢了领先。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/53
msgid ""
"It was really close, though.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过比分很接近。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/54
msgid ""
"We congratulated each other on a good match\n"
msgstr ""
"我们互相祝贺这场好比赛\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/55
msgid ""
"and sprawled out in the shade on the deck,\n"
"exhausted.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后精疲力尽地瘫在甲板的\n"
"阴凉处。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/56
msgid ""
"The ocean breeze felt so nice on my sun-soaked\n"
"body.\n"
msgstr ""
"海风吹着我晒热的\n"
"身子，真舒服。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/57
msgid ""
"Nuke came over - it is one of his favorite spots -\n"
msgstr ""
"努克也来了，他最爱这儿\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/58
msgid ""
"and stretched out next to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"在我旁边伸展开来。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/59
msgid ""
"And together\n"
msgstr ""
"我们一起\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/60
msgid ""
"we watched fluffy white clouds drift lazily across\n"
"the clear blue sky.\n"
msgstr ""
"看着蓬松的白云懒洋洋地飘过\n"
"清澈的蓝天。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/0
msgid ""
"The sleeper that she'd worked so hard to place\n"
"was a double agent.\n"
msgstr ""
"她费尽心思安插的卧底\n"
"是个双面间谍。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/1
msgid ""
"He'd been turned by the Soviets and was feeding\n"
"the Americans lies.\n"
msgstr ""
"他被苏联人策反，一直在给\n"
"美国人喂假情报。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/2
msgid ""
"But what shocked The Boss even more was why.\n"
msgstr ""
"但更让THE BOSS震惊的是原因。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/3
msgid ""
"The CIA's access agent had been taking a large\n"
"cut of the sleeper's pay.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA特工一直从这潜伏者薪水里\n"
"抽走一大笔。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/4
msgid ""
"The sleeper felt what little he was left with wasn't\n"
"worth the risk.\n"
msgstr ""
"潜伏者觉得剩下的这点钱\n"
"不值得冒这个险。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/5
msgid ""
"When he got a better offer from Moscow, he took\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"莫斯科给更好条件，他就接了\n"
"。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/6
msgid ""
"At some point,\n"
msgstr ""
"不知何时\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/7
msgid ""
"the Americans' intelligence operation had become\n"
"an open book to the Soviets.\n"
msgstr ""
"美国人的情报行动对苏联人来说\n"
"已是一本摊开的书。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/8
msgid ""
"And contrary to what the sleeper'd been reporting,\n"
msgstr ""
"而与潜伏者一直汇报的相反，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/9
msgid ""
"the Soviets' manned spaceflight technology was\n"
"quite advanced.\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联的载人航天技术\n"
"相当先进。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/10
msgid ""
"It wasn't until she infiltrated OKB-1 herself\n"
msgstr ""
"直到她亲自潜入OKB-1，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/11
msgid ""
"that The Boss learned the truth about Sputnik 5.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS才得知人造卫星5号的真相。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/12
msgid ""
"After the spacecraft reentered the atmosphere, it\n"
"ejected the pilot\n"
msgstr ""
"飞船重返大气层后，在7000米高空\n"
"弹射出飞行员\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/13
msgid ""
"- seat and all - at an altitude of 7,000 meters.\n"
msgstr ""
"- 连同座椅一起。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/14
msgid ""
"It was the Soviets' solution to the problem of land\n"
"recovery.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是苏联人对土地\n"
"恢复问题的解决方案。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/15
msgid ""
"The mystery device attached to Sputnik 5 was for\n"
"that purpose.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sputnik 5上的神秘装置就为\n"
"此而设。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/16
msgid ""
"The pilot would parachute down from that high\n"
"altitude wearing a bulky spacesuit...\n"
msgstr ""
"飞行员将穿着笨重的宇航服从那样的高空\n"
"跳伞降落……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/17
msgid ""
"Crazy, I know.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道，很疯狂。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/18
msgid ""
"The Soviets knew exactly how dangerous it was, of\n"
"course.\n"
msgstr ""
"当然，苏联人非常清楚它有多危险\n"
"。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/19
msgid ""
"So much so that they gave Yuri Gagarin, the first\n"
"man in space,\n"
msgstr ""
"以至于他们给了尤里·加加林，首位\n"
"太空人，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/20
msgid ""
"a special two-rank promotion before reentry.\n"
msgstr ""
"在重返前特批连升两级。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/21
msgid ""
"Only Moscow could come up with this kind of plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"只有莫斯科才想得出这种计划。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/22
msgid ""
"With total state control over information,\n"
msgstr ""
"凭借国家对信息的全面控制，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/23
msgid ""
"they could easily pretend it never happened in the\n"
"event of a failure...\n"
msgstr ""
"一旦失败，他们可以轻易装作\n"
"从未发生……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/24
msgid ""
"The Boss passed the info on to NASA. It was their\n"
"worst nightmare.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS把情报给了NASA。那是他们\n"
"最可怕的噩梦。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/25
msgid ""
"The glory of mankind's first spaceflight was about\n"
"to be stolen from them by the Soviet Union.\n"
msgstr ""
"人类首次太空飞行的荣耀即将\n"
"被苏联夺走。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/26
msgid ""
"It was Sputnik all over again...\n"
msgstr ""
"又是人造卫星重演……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/27
msgid ""
"And the CIA was caught no less off guard.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA也同样措手不及。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/28
msgid ""
"Their ineptitude had caused the fiasco in the first\n"
"place.\n"
msgstr ""
"正是他们的无能\n"
"才导致了这场惨败。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/29
msgid ""
"The Soviets' deception was brilliant. They'd woven\n"
"a masterful tapestry of truth and fiction\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联人的欺骗手段堪称绝妙。他们编织了\n"
"一幅真假交织的精妙画卷\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/30
msgid ""
"to convince the Americans their intelligence\n"
"operations were proceeding as planned.\n"
msgstr ""
"让美国人相信他们的情报\n"
"行动正按计划进行。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/31
msgid ""
"No one but The Boss could have seen through it...\n"
msgstr ""
"除了THE BOSS，没人能看穿……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/32
msgid ""
"It was obvious the Soviets had some gifted minds\n"
"working on their side.\n"
msgstr ""
"显然苏联人有一些\n"
"天赋异禀的人才在为他们效力。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/33
msgid ""
"But that certainly didn't excuse the CIA's massive\n"
"failure.\n"
msgstr ""
"但这绝不能为中央情报局的重大\n"
"失误开脱。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/34
msgid ""
"The CIA wasn't done, though,\n"
msgstr ""
"但CIA没罢手，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/35
msgid ""
"and devised an ingenious plan to avoid taking\n"
"responsibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"并设计了一个巧妙的计划来逃避\n"
"承担责任。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/36
msgid ""
"Luckily for them, a new President had been elected\n"
"the previous November - John F. Kennedy.\n"
msgstr ""
"对他们来说幸运的是，前一年十一月新当选了一位总统——约翰·F·肯尼迪。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/37
msgid ""
"As he didn't know the case history when taking\n"
"office,\n"
msgstr ""
"由于他上任时并不了解事件的来龙去脉，\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/38
msgid ""
"the CIA was able to feed lies to his new\n"
"administration.\n"
msgstr ""
"中情局得以向他新组建的政府灌输谎言。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/39
msgid ""
"They masked their own failures, placing the blame\n"
"squarely on The Boss's shoulders.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们掩盖了自己的失败，把责任一股脑儿推到了“头儿”的肩上。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/40
msgid ""
"After all, she'd selected an unreliable sleeper.\n"
msgstr ""
"毕竟，她选了个靠不住的潜伏者。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/41
msgid ""
"They claimed she'd failed to make use of one of\n"
"the most effective means\n"
msgstr ""
"他们声称她没能利用起最有效的手段之一，\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/42
msgid ""
"of controlling a sleeper agent's actions.\n"
msgstr ""
"即控制其行动的办法。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/43
msgid ""
"Holding their family hostage.\n"
msgstr ""
"扣押其家人当人质。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/44
msgid ""
"The Boss was well aware that would have worked -\n"
"she told me so later.\n"
msgstr ""
"“头儿”很清楚那样做本会奏效——她后来告诉了我。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/45
msgid ""
"But she couldn't bring herself to do it...\n"
msgstr ""
"但她下不了手……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/46
msgid ""
"It seems clear it had to do with having her own\n"
"child taken.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来很明显，这与她自己的孩子被人夺走有关。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/47
msgid ""
"She could never inflict the same pain on anyone\n"
"else.\n"
msgstr ""
"她绝不会把同样的痛苦加诸于任何人身上。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/48
msgid ""
"The CIA used that against her.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA利用这点对付她。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/49
msgid ""
"In his election campaign, Kennedy had vowed to\n"
"close the missile gap with Moscow.\n"
msgstr ""
"在竞选活动中，肯尼迪曾誓言要弥合与莫斯科之间的导弹差距。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/50
msgid ""
"If America lost the space race, that promise would\n"
"be worthless.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果美国输掉了太空竞赛，那个承诺就将一文不值。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/51
msgid ""
"The fact that the President had no links to the\n"
"Philosophers only made things worse.\n"
msgstr ""
"总统与“哲人”毫无关联，这反而让情况变得更糟。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/52
msgid ""
"He was completely unaware of the secret networks\n"
"she'd used to complete her mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"他完全不知道她曾利用哪些秘密网络来完成自己的任务。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/53
msgid ""
"In his eyes, she was no better than a traitor.\n"
msgstr ""
"在他眼里，她无异于叛徒。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/54
msgid ""
"The fate that awaited her was cruel beyond belief...\n"
msgstr ""
"等待她的命运残酷得难以想象……\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/0
msgid ""
"America couldn't let the Soviets beat them with\n"
"Vostok.\n"
msgstr ""
"美国不能让苏联人用东方号\n"
"抢先。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/1
msgid ""
"NASA was forced to cut short the testing process\n"
"and move the launch date up.\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA被迫缩短测试流程\n"
"提前发射日期。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/2
msgid ""
"They pulled out all the stops to get it scheduled\n"
"for the earliest hours of the next day.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们不惜一切代价，把发射\n"
"定在次日凌晨。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/3
msgid ""
"The spacecraft would be launched from Cape\n"
"Canaveral in the dead of night.\n"
msgstr ""
"飞船将在深夜从卡纳维拉尔角\n"
"发射升空。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/4
msgid ""
"For the flight path, they chose a course that would\n"
"take her as far east as possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们选了一条尽量向东的\n"
"飞行路线。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/5
msgid ""
"She'd be able to see the Earth in daylight from the\n"
"window, at least for a little while.\n"
msgstr ""
"她至少能透过舷窗短暂地\n"
"看到白昼中的地球。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/6
msgid ""
"The Boss climbed into the Mercury capsule\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS爬进水星号太空舱\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/7
#, c-format
msgid ""
"having completed less than 80% of the regular\n"
"flight procedures.\n"
msgstr ""
"此时常规飞行程序\n"
"完成不到80%。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/8
msgid ""
"Both the timing and the flight path were risky, and\n"
"testing was far from complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"时机和航线都很冒险，\n"
"测试远未完成。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/9
msgid ""
"But NASA had no other choice.\n"
msgstr ""
"但NASA别无选择。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/10
msgid ""
"The Boss, for her part, never expected to come\n"
"home alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"而THE BOSS自己，从没想过\n"
"能活着回来。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/11
msgid ""
"She was going on a one-way trip. The American\n"
"version of Laika the dog.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是一趟单程旅行。美国的\n"
"莱卡狗。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/12
msgid ""
"And yet she went all the same.\n"
msgstr ""
"可她还是去了。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/13
msgid ""
"\"Someone has to be first,\" she said. \"If fate has\n"
"chosen me, then I accept.\n"
msgstr ""
"“总得有人先来，”她说。“命运\n"
"选了我，我就接受。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/14
msgid ""
"For my country. For the balance of the world.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"为我的国家。为世界平衡。”\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/15
msgid ""
"That's how she saw things.\n"
msgstr ""
"她就是这么想的。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/16
msgid ""
"\"My chances may be slim, but I'll take them. I've\n"
"accepted my fate.\n"
msgstr ""
"“机会也许渺茫，但我要抓住。我已\n"
"接受命运。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/17
msgid ""
"If anyone can get through this, I can.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"如果有人能挺过去，那就是我。”\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/18
msgid ""
"Then, on April 12, at one thirty in the morning, The\n"
"Boss entered space.\n"
msgstr ""
"4月12日凌晨一点半，THE\n"
"BOSS进入了太空。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/19
msgid ""
"It was nothing short of a miracle.\n"
msgstr ""
"这简直是奇迹。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/20
msgid ""
"First, that she'd made it in an incomplete\n"
"spacecraft.\n"
msgstr ""
"第一，她乘着未完成的\n"
"飞船成功了。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/21
msgid ""
"And second, that her flight coincided almost\n"
"exactly with Gagarin's.\n"
msgstr ""
"第二，她的飞行几乎与\n"
"加加林完全重合。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/22
msgid ""
"As the sun rose over the horizon\n"
msgstr ""
"当太阳从地平线升起\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/23
msgid ""
"- and cosmic rays began to bombard her through\n"
"the window - she saw the Earth.\n"
msgstr ""
"- 宇宙射线开始穿过窗户轰击她 -\n"
"她看到了地球。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/24
msgid ""
"I think you've heard the story before.\n"
msgstr ""
"这故事你大概听过。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/25
msgid ""
"It was a world without borders. A perfect jewel.\n"
msgstr ""
"那是无国界的世界。完美宝石。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/26
msgid ""
"All nations, all ideologies - they seemed so far away.\n"
msgstr ""
"所有国家、意识形态，都那么遥远。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/27
msgid ""
"It almost made her laugh, knowing that they'd\n"
"risked so much\n"
msgstr ""
"想到他们冒了这么大风险，\n"
"她几乎笑了出来\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/28
msgid ""
"to beat the Soviets by a few short minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"只为比苏联人快几分钟。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/29
msgid ""
"If she'd seen Vostok from her window, she\n"
"probably would have waved.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果她从窗户看到了东方号，\n"
"她大概会挥挥手。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/30
msgid ""
"But the two spacecraft were destined for very\n"
"different fates.\n"
msgstr ""
"但这两艘飞船注定要面对\n"
"截然不同的命运。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/31
msgid ""
"Gagarin circled the Earth and returned to the\n"
"Soviet Union safe and sound.\n"
msgstr ""
"加加林绕地球飞行后，\n"
"安然无恙地返回了苏联。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/32
msgid ""
"The Mercury capsule, on the other hand, deviated\n"
"from its planned reentry angle.\n"
msgstr ""
"而水星号太空舱，则偏离了\n"
"计划中的再入角度。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/33
msgid ""
"The addition of a window had thrown the capsule's\n"
"aerodynamics off balance.\n"
msgstr ""
"加装窗户破坏了太空舱的\n"
"空气动力学平衡。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/34
msgid ""
"The Boss's 'coffin' veered wildly off course, and\n"
"began to plunge earthward...\n"
msgstr ""
"老板的“棺材”剧烈偏离航线，\n"
"开始向地面坠落……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/0
msgid ""
"...It's me.\n"
msgstr ""
"……是我。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/1
msgid ""
"Smoothly, naturally.\n"
msgstr ""
"平稳、自然。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/2
msgid ""
"No, Big Boss doesn't know the truth...\n"
msgstr ""
"不，BIG BOSS不知道真相……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/3
msgid ""
"No, Langley hasn't decided what to do yet.\n"
msgstr ""
"不，兰利还没决定怎么办。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/4
msgid ""
"Their hands are full with their own mess.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们自己烂摊子都忙不过来。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/5
msgid ""
"True, Lubyanka is in the same boat...\n"
msgstr ""
"没错，卢比扬卡也一样……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/6
msgid ""
"Yes, other eyes continue to watch, but no sign of\n"
"contact so far.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的，其他眼睛仍在看，但至今无\n"
"接触迹象。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/7
msgid ""
"...Exactly. It's a non-state army to use however\n"
"they want.\n"
msgstr ""
"……没错。非国家军队，任由\n"
"他们使用。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/8
msgid ""
"They've probably decided there's no sense in\n"
"wiping them out just yet.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们大概认定，现在\n"
"将他们彻底消灭毫无意义。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/9
msgid ""
"Better to make... use of them.\n"
msgstr ""
"不如……利用他们。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/10
msgid ""
"Indeed they have... There's a site near Angola...\n"
msgstr ""
"确实……安哥拉附近有个据点……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/11
msgid ""
"And we've fully validated the AI as well...\n"
msgstr ""
"AI也已完全验证……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/12
msgid ""
"Agreed. In the end, a machine is just that: a\n"
"machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"同意。机器终究只是：\n"
"机器。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/13
msgid ""
"Sigint was right. It seems it's time for a change in\n"
"approach.\n"
msgstr ""
"SIGINT说得对。看来是时候改变\n"
"策略了。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/14
msgid ""
"Machines are best suited to specialize in high-level\n"
"data processing.\n"
msgstr ""
"机器最适合专门处理高级\n"
"数据。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/15
msgid ""
"Yes... Of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的……当然。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/16
msgid ""
"Speaking of which, any news on the \"sons\"...?\n"
msgstr ""
"说到这个，“儿子们”有消息吗……？\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/17
msgid ""
"Two already... Really...\n"
msgstr ""
"已经两个了……真的……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/18
msgid ""
"...But they're strictly an insurance policy, yes?\n"
msgstr ""
"……但他们只是保险措施，对吧？\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/19
msgid ""
"Mmmmm... So that's the idea...\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯……原来如此……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/20
msgid ""
"I wonder how Big Boss will respond...\n"
msgstr ""
"不知BIG BOSS会怎么回应……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/21
msgid ""
"Yes. But I'm only interested in the business angle.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的。但我只对生意感兴趣。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/22
msgid ""
"Like I said before, I'm neither an enemy nor an ally.\n"
msgstr ""
"我说过了，我既不是敌人也不是盟友。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/23
msgid ""
"I'm merely a business partner. Don't forget it.\n"
msgstr ""
"我只是生意伙伴。别忘了。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/24
msgid ""
"Yes, I'll be in touch...\n"
msgstr ""
"好，我会联系你的……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/25
msgid ""
"my dear Zero (CIPHER).\n"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的ZERO（Cipher）。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/0
msgid ""
"How's that map, Snake? Think you can\n"
"use it?\n"
msgstr ""
"地图怎样，Snake？你能\n"
"用上吗？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/1
msgid ""
"It tells me where their bases are, but it's\n"
"just a bunch of points.\n"
msgstr ""
"能看出他们的基地在哪，但只是\n"
"一堆点。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/2
msgid ""
"No routes. I need better intel on the lay\n"
"of the land.\n"
msgstr ""
"没有路线。我需要更详细的地形\n"
"情报。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/3
msgid ""
"Snake, the \"professor\" said he's got the\n"
"Sandinistas on his side.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，“教授”说他得到了\n"
"桑地诺派的支持。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/4
msgid ""
"Said you should get in touch with the\n"
"FSLN comandante.\n"
msgstr ""
"让你联系FSLN的\n"
"指挥官。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/5
msgid ""
"Do they know they're backed by KGB?\n"
msgstr ""
"他们知道背后是克格勃？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/6
msgid ""
"Nah... As far as they know they're really\n"
"fighting for the revolution.\n"
msgstr ""
"不知道……他们以为自己在\n"
"为革命而战。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/7
msgid ""
"The KGB is staying behind the scenes.\n"
msgstr ""
"克格勃躲在幕后。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/8
msgid ""
"I'm not sure the Sandinistas are aware of\n"
"what's really going on.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不确定桑地诺派是否清楚\n"
"真实情况。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/9
msgid ""
"Still can't believe anybody'd bring nukes\n"
"here...\n"
msgstr ""
"还是不信有人会把核弹\n"
"带这来……\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/10
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's a shocker.\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，太震惊。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/11
msgid ""
"Costa Rica's party to the Tlatelolco\n"
"Treaty,\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加是特拉特洛尔科\n"
"条约的缔约国，\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/12
msgid ""
"which declares Latin America a nuke-free\n"
"zone.\n"
msgstr ""
"宣布拉丁美洲为无核\n"
"区。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/13
msgid ""
"Based on Japan's Three Non-Nuclear\n"
"Principles,\n"
msgstr ""
"基于日本的无核三\n"
"原则，\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/14
msgid ""
"it bans the testing, use, import, or\n"
"deployment of nuclear weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"它禁止核武器的试验、使用、进口或\n"
"部署。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/15
msgid ""
"If word of this gets out, OPANAL will be\n"
"forced to act.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果消息泄露，OPANAL将\n"
"被迫采取行动。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/16
msgid ""
"It'll cause an international uproar.\n"
msgstr ""
"会引发国际轩然大波。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/17
msgid ""
"The Treaty was signed to prevent\n"
"another Cuban Missile Crisis.\n"
msgstr ""
"签这条约就为防\n"
"古巴导弹危机重演。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/18
msgid ""
"If the U.S. itself is going to scrap it...\n"
msgstr ""
"如果美国自己要撕毁它……\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/19
msgid ""
"Latin America's too close to spawning\n"
"another Cuba or two already.\n"
msgstr ""
"拉丁美洲已经太接近催生\n"
"又一个或两个古巴了。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/20
msgid ""
"The entire continent would become one\n"
"big powder keg.\n"
msgstr ""
"整个大陆将变成一个\n"
"巨大的火药桶。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/21
msgid ""
"Well... If they did bring nukes, we can't let\n"
"them get away with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"好吧……若他们真带了核武，不能放\n"
"他们走。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/22
msgid ""
"Are they planning a test? Showing off?\n"
msgstr ""
"他们打算试验？还是炫耀？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/23
msgid ""
"Or is it all to keep the anti-American\n"
"movement in check?\n"
msgstr ""
"还是说这一切都是为了遏制反美\n"
"运动？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/24
msgid ""
"Good question. Why bring them here? I\n"
"can't figure it out.\n"
msgstr ""
"好问题。为何带他们来这？我\n"
"想不通。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/25
msgid ""
"Whatever the CIA's up to in Costa Rica,\n"
"the \"professor\" wants it stopped.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管CIA在哥斯达黎加搞什么，\n"
"“教授”都要它停。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/26
msgid ""
"We need to find out what that something\n"
"is.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们需要查明那东西\n"
"是什么。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/27
msgid ""
"We need to get ready first, Kaz. Repairs?\n"
msgstr ""
"得先准备，卡兹。修理呢？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/28
msgid ""
"Working as fast as we can, Boss. This\n"
"place is pretty beat... It looks like hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们尽快干，老大。这\n"
"地方真破……像地狱。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/29
msgid ""
"But as long as you're with us, we'll make\n"
"it heaven.\n"
msgstr ""
"但只要你和我们在一起，我们会让\n"
"它变成天堂。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/30
msgid ""
"No one can bother us here. No state\n"
"telling us what to do.\n"
msgstr ""
"这没人打扰我们。没国家\n"
"叫我们干啥。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/31
msgid ""
"This is the MSF's haven, our Mother Base.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是MSF的避风港，母基地。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/32
msgid ""
"And with this foothold, we'll back you up\n"
"even better than before.\n"
msgstr ""
"有了这个立足点，我们会比以前\n"
"更好地支持你。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/33
msgid ""
"We're gonna turn this pile of junk into\n"
"something big.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们要把这堆垃圾变成\n"
"了不起的东西。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I rigged that radio so you can\n"
"contact our young lady friend Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，我改了那台无线电，你能\n"
"联系咱年轻朋友Paz。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/1
msgid ""
"Is she OK?\n"
msgstr ""
"她还好吗？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/2
msgid ""
"No need to worry. She's tougher than you\n"
"think...\n"
msgstr ""
"别担心。她比你\n"
"想的更坚强……\n"
